WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:02.360
This is Diorame inside and out,

2
00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:05.030
a quick rundown of everything
right at your fingertips.

3
00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.460
We start in Drawing mode.

4
00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.260
Top left, your .dior file.

5
00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.570
New, open, save and undo.

6
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:18.710
Right in the middle, toggle between Draw
and Cinema, and jump into animation.

7
00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:24.630
On the right, export to SVG,
PNG or Super Riso, plus light or dark paper.

8
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.390
At the bottom, your tools.

9
00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.690
Just two for drawing: Blob and Brush.

10
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:32.840
Along with their modifiers: symmetry,
draw inside or behind,

11
00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:34.500
organic stroke and smoothing.

12
00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.680
On the side, your layers.

13
00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.010
Up to ten, each one at a different depth.

14
00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.900
These dots show which layer you're on.

15
00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:43.500
One click and you jump right to it.

16
00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.840
Open them up for name, finish
and locking them in 3D.

17
00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:49.010
Two preset palettes, Main and Alt.

18
00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.810
Flat, gradient or fade per layer.

19
00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.630
Plus, swap colorways in a click.

20
00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.160
Bottom left, the composition guide.

21
00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:57.430
Now, Cinema mode.

22
00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:01.230
Eleven ready-to-use camera moves,
from tracking shots to crane.

23
00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:16.450
The camera bar: preset, speed,
handheld, focal length and depth.

24
00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.650
Effects, right at hand on the side.

25
00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:22.360
Grain, vignette, bloom, fog, pixel art

26
00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.910
and Super Riso to give it that printed look.

27
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:43.340
And to export: PNG capture or video,
and GIF if you're animating.

28
00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.370
And that's Diorame.

29
00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:46.650
The rest is up to you.

30
00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:47.960
diorame.com

